{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/13f2767d6eeef5c039d1a9d89dcf098a.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. <br><br>You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/723fc277796e97032bd7229a9db49a5f.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Answered Prayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139570/9d7d54a0fe9e23f36b9bafea368ee94f568ca597.jpg"},{"name":"Loss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139570/9d7d54a0fe9e23f36b9bafea368ee94f568ca597.jpg"},{"name":"Suffer a Brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139570/9d7d54a0fe9e23f36b9bafea368ee94f568ca597.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139570/9d7d54a0fe9e23f36b9bafea368ee94f568ca597.jpg"},{"name":"Studious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139570/b5b7ab626d3c5116ca9ec224624dd2103547246e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139570?t=1766070019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139570?t=1766070019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766070019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766070019","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><